    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "**Source:** vLLM `/metrics` gauge `vllm:num_requests_running` (scraped by Prometheus job `mock-vllm` or `vllm-metal` — **not** the gateway).\n\n**Why zero?** On **metal** dev, real vLLM often reports **0** when requests finish faster than the 5s scrape (light simulator load). Mock mode exposes static demo values (2 running / 5 waiting). Gateway `gateway_inflight_requests` can be >0 while vLLM shows 0 — different measurement points.\n\nClickHouse copy every **15s** in `vllm_system_metrics` (see ClickHouse dashboard).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }, "unit": "short" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 38 },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (model_name, instance) ({__name__=\"vllm:num_requests_running\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{model_name}} {{instance}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max_over_time(sum({__name__=\"vllm:num_requests_running\"})[5m:])",
          "legendFormat": "peak (5m)",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "vLLM running requests",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "**Source:** vLLM `/metrics` gauge `vllm:num_requests_waiting` (queue depth). Often **0** on metal under light load; mock mode returns a static demo value.\n\nClickHouse copy every **15s** in `vllm_system_metrics.queue_depth`.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }, "unit": "short" },
        "overrides": []
